repository-code: "https://github.com/Yama1Da/Network-Pharmacology"
abstract: >-
  A one-stop network pharmacology analysis platform: given a drug and a
  disease, it automatically performs target acquisition (DisGeNET, DGIdb,
  Open Targets, ChEMBL), PPI network construction and topological analysis
  (STRING), GO/KEGG enrichment analysis (g:Profiler / Enrichr), and AutoDock
  Vina molecular docking. GEO transcriptomics with six-algorithm machine
  learning consensus screening (LASSO, Elastic Net, Ridge, SVM-RFE,
  RF+Boruta, XGBoost) shortlists targets for wet-lab validation.
keywords:
  - network pharmacology
  - PPI network
  - enrichment analysis
  - molecular docking
  - AutoDock Vina
  - machine learning
  - drug targets
